  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat. ",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 8 minutes. ",
    "Add the beer and bring to a boil. ",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes. ",
    "Strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean pot. ",
    "Discard the solids and season with salt to taste. ",
    "Serve hot, garnished with parsley or chives if desired. "
